 "▼ Dive in: <0>Approval gate</0>": "",
 "Autonomy is a dial, not a switch: from \"human does everything\" to \"agent acts alone\". Pick the level per <0>action risk</0>, not per product.": "",
 "Side-effecting tools (book_table, send_email, delete_file) deserve an <0>approval gate</0>; read-only tools usually do not.": "",
 "L0–L4 here is a teaching scale, not an industry standard.": "",
 "Too many prompts cause approval fatigue: gate on risk (irreversibility, cost, external visibility) and let the harness remember narrow allow rules.": "",
